## 1. Description

Anti-Scam Trap Bot is a Discord bot designed to help server administrators detect and prevent scam activity by monitoring configured trap channels and automatically applying administrator-selected punishments.

The Bot may delete messages, timeout users, ban users, and send moderation logs depending on the configuration selected by the server administrator.

