## 3. Automatic Moderation

The Bot may automatically take action against users who send messages in configured trap channels.

Depending on the server configuration, actions may include:

* Deleting the triggering message.
* Temporarily timing out the user.
* Permanently banning the user.
* Recording moderation information in the configured log channel.
* Removing other messages from the affected user within the configured period.

The Bot does not guarantee that every scam, malicious message, or abusive user will be detected.

